        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>With vacation season upon us, it\u2019s time to figure out what to pack for your trips, whether it\u2019s gear for the car, accessories that help you connect to your entertainment, or gadgets for backing up all your pics.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here at PCWorld, we\u2019re always testing the latest gadgets to sort the good from the don\u2019t-bother. In the process, we\u2019ve come across a lot of travel-friendly tech gear actually worth bringing along.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We\u2019ve curated a list of the gear that we believe is worthy of any packing list and sure to prepare you for anything you may encounter on the road\u2014or in the sky. Happy travels!</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-idg-base-theme-listicle-chart-block wp-block-product-chart product-chart\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-listicle-chart\"><div class=\"wp-block-listicle-chart-item listicle-chart-item\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading  \" id=\"manage-electrical-needs-wi",
